{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS2MaKq919vt4AqFa8XA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the Connect flow and wrote the causes into `ANSWER.md`. The server compiles, but I haven't run the flow or tested it against live Intervals.icu. I can't reach external services from here.\n\nCauses:\n1. **Connect button failed for everyone.** It was a plain link to a GET endpoint. A page navigation doesn't send the `Authorization` header, so the server answered 401. Init is now an authenticated POST that returns `{authorize_url}`, and the SPA navigates to it.\n2. **Authorize link rejected with 400.** The scope list named the same area twice (`ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE`, `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`), which Intervals refuses. It is now `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`. The 400 body doesn't say which parameter it objected to, so this is my best reading of the logs.\n3. **\"Reconnect\" after an hour.** Intervals tokens have no `refresh_token` or expiry, but the code invented a 3600s lifetime and expired every connection after it. I removed the lifetime and the refresher thread. A 401 from Intervals now marks the user as needing to reconnect.\n4. **Token exchange.** It sent `grant_type` and `redirect_uri`, which Intervals doesn't want. It now sends only `client_id`, `client_secret` and `code`.\n\nFrom the colleague's note, all four points applied. I also added a `purpose` check to the signed `state` and a guard that rejects a reconnect from a different athlete. I didn't switch `state` to a JWT, and I didn't add encryption at rest because the store here is in-memory. `ANSWER.md` says which parts applied.\n\n`config.py` still has the dev placeholder credentials and `APP_SECRET`, so replace those in deploy. The edits are in `server.py`, `config.py` and `static/app.js`, and nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3045,"cache_read_input_tokens":29705,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3045},"output_tokens":664,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b84cd23-226c-407f-b80b-76c6e21c7ca3","uuid":"d4aa547b-f709-4a2f-a4ae-34810411d6b7","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:22:35.214Z","request_id":"req_011CgS2Ma5CM6LsVuiWJFAkj"}
